"An app can no longer claim other apps' files as its own leftovers by naming itself unusually." = "应用不能再通过使用异常名称，把其他应用的文件说成自己的残留。";
"An app that keeps the Mac awake can now be narrowed to the situation you mean: only with an external display, only on power, or both." = "让 Mac 保持唤醒的应用现在可以限定条件：仅连接外接显示器时、仅接通电源时，或两者同时。";
