"Anything that needs a system permission now says so where you turn it on — Disk, App Uninstaller, Login Items and Keep Awake all warn before they can disappoint you." = "凡需要系统权限的功能，都会在你开启处提示——磁盘、卸载器、登录项与保持唤醒。";
"App" = "应用";
"App Uninstaller module: remove apps together with their caches, settings and other leftovers; find leftovers of apps that are already gone." = "卸载器模块：连同缓存、设置等残留一并删除；还可查找已删除应用的残留。";
"App Uninstaller no longer offers the files of installed apps as leftovers. Apps kept one folder down — Adobe Acrobat DC, Microsoft Office — were invisible to it, and nothing is pre-selected any more." = "卸载器不再把已安装应用的文件当作残留。位于子文件夹中的应用此前不可见；且不再预先勾选任何项。";
"App Uninstaller opens straight away. It used to measure every app on your Mac before showing anything — four seconds, nine on a cold start. The list appears now and the sizes fill in behind it." = "卸载器立即打开。此前它会先测量每个应用才显示内容——四秒，冷启动九秒。现在先出列表，容量随后补上。";
