"Each login item now offers what is actually possible: turn it off, show it in Finder, or delete it — with a word about why, when a password would be needed." = "每个登录项只提供实际可行的操作：关闭、在访达中显示或删除——需要密码时会说明原因。";
"Each module’s saved data and the diagnostics log go to the Trash, where you can get them back. Your preferences — which modules are on, their order, your shortcuts — are forgotten for good. Helm restarts and greets you as it did the first time." = "每个模块保存的数据和诊断日志会移到废纸篓，你可以从那里取回。设置本身（哪些模块已开启、它们的顺序、你的快捷键）则会被永久遗忘。Helm 会重启，并像第一次那样迎接你。";
