"Escape closes the menu-bar panel, the way it closes every other menu on the Mac. It could be opened with a keyboard shortcut and then only be closed with the mouse." = "按 Esc 键即可关闭菜单栏面板，就像关闭 Mac 上的其他菜单一样。此前可以用快捷键打开，却只能用鼠标关闭。";
"Every layout has a real flag now. Helm drew them itself for a while, but a table of bands and crosses cannot hold Mexico’s eagle, Portugal’s armillary sphere or Korea’s trigrams — half a dozen flags were approximations because of it. These come from flag-icons under the MIT licence (credited on this page): rectangular, accurate, and legible down to the smallest badge size. A layout that names no country still keeps its letters." = "每个布局现在都有真正的旗帜：MIT 许可的 flag-icons（本页已署名）。矩形、准确，最小尺寸下依然清晰。没有国家归属的布局仍保持字母显示。";
"Everything" = "全部";
"Everything is up to date." = "全部已是最新。";
"Expanded" = "已展开";
