"Fix as I type" = "输入时自动修正";
"Fix with" = "修正键";
"Fixes words typed in the wrong keyboard layout" = "修正用错误键盘布局输入的单词";
"Flag" = "旗帜";
"Flag, system" = "旗帜（系统）";
"Folder" = "文件夹";
"Folders that keep themselves in order" = "会自己保持整齐的文件夹";
"Follow" = "跟随";
"Force quit and remove anyway" = "强制退出并删除";
"Full Disk Access" = "完全磁盘访问权限";
"Full disk access is off. Without it the disk scan cannot read every folder, and removing an app leaves its containers behind." = "磁盘访问已关闭。扫描无法读取全部文件夹，卸载应用时容器会残留。";
"Full name" = "完整名称";
"General" = "通用";
"GitHub update check and the What’s New window." = "GitHub 更新检查与“新增内容”窗口。";
"Global shortcut" = "全局快捷键";
"Got it" = "明白了";
"Grant…" = "授予…";
"Green" = "绿色";
"Group Containers" = "群组容器";
"Helm Settings" = "Helm 设置";
"Helm can be used with VoiceOver. Every control now says what it is — the rule editor was built from pop-up buttons and fields that announced nothing, so a rule could not be written at all without sight." = "现在可以用旁白操作 Helm：每个控件都会说明自己是什么。此前规则编辑器不做任何朗读，看不见就无法使用。";
"Helm could crash outright when an application quit while the VPN module happened to be looking at the list of running programs." = "当某个程序恰好在 VPN 模块查看运行中程序列表时退出，Helm 可能直接崩溃。";
"Helm downloads Homebrew’s own installer and runs it. macOS asks for an administrator password once, to create /opt/homebrew." = "Helm 会下载 Homebrew 官方安装脚本并运行。为创建 /opt/homebrew，macOS 会要求输入一次管理员密码。";
"Helm introduces itself. On a new installation a short tour opens once: what Helm is, then one screen per module, with Back, Next and Skip. It only tells you what is there — nothing is switched on and no permission is asked for. If Helm was already installed, you get it once too, because Autopilot and Duplicates arrived without ever being introduced." = "Helm 会自我介绍了。全新安装时会打开一次简短导览：先说明 Helm 是什么，然后每个模块一屏，可以上一步、下一步或跳过。它只做介绍——不会开启任何功能，也不索取权限。如果你已经在用 Helm，同样会看到一次：自动整理和重复文件当初是悄悄出现的。";
"Helm is made of modules. Each one does a single job, and you can switch off the ones you do not want." = "Helm 由若干模块组成。每个模块只做一件事，不需要的可以关掉。";
"Helm is missing permissions it needs" = "Helm 缺少所需权限";
"Helm is not watching the keyboard" = "Helm 未在监视键盘";
"Helm is still in development. Beta builds are the steadier of the two." = "Helm 仍在开发中。两者之中 Beta 更稳定。";
"Helm needs Full Disk Access to move this." = "移动此项需要完全磁盘访问权限。";
"Helm returns to how it was just after installing. Access you granted in System Settings stays as it is." = "Helm 会回到刚安装完的状态。你在系统设置中授予的权限不受影响。";
"Helm shows the settings, caches and support files it left behind, ready to remove. Only while the app is still in the Trash — empty it first and there is nothing left to identify them by." = "Helm 会列出它留下的设置、缓存和支持文件，可直接删除。仅在 App 还在废纸篓里时有效——清倒之后就无法辨认这些文件了。";
"Helm’s language now reaches the parts macOS draws for it. The folder picker, its sidebar and the menus on a text field were English whatever language you had chosen. Numbers and dates follow the language too: a count of files is grouped the way your language groups digits, and a date is written the way your language writes one." = "Helm 的语言现在也适用于 macOS 为它绘制的部分：选择文件夹的窗口、它的边栏以及文本框的菜单此前始终是英文。数字和日期也会按你的语言书写。";
"Helm’s own copy of the menu-bar indicator, with the choices the system’s one does not offer. macOS shows its own — turn that one off in Keyboard settings, or you get two." = "菜单栏指示器的自有副本，带有系统版本没有的选项。系统的那个仍在：请在键盘设置中关闭，否则会有两个。";
"Homebrew" = "Homebrew";
"Homebrew is no longer installed." = "Homebrew 已被卸载。";
"Homebrew isn’t installed" = "未安装 Homebrew";
"Homebrew module: installed packages, updates, search and install, with a live console and package descriptions." = "Homebrew 模块：已安装包、更新、搜索与安装，带实时控制台和包描述。";
"Homebrew removes it right away. It does not go to the Trash, and this cannot be undone." = "Homebrew 会立即删除。它不会进入废纸篓，也无法撤销。";
"Homebrew search tells apps and command-line tools apart again, so installing an app installs the app." = "Homebrew 搜索重新区分应用与命令行工具，安装应用时装的就是应用。";
"How to compare" = "如何比较";
"Icon shape" = "图标形状";
"Icon size" = "图标大小";
"If the folder Helm last measured has since been deleted, Disk no longer opens on an empty screen with no explanation — it takes you back to the volume list. An empty folder now says it is empty instead of showing nothing." = "如果上次测量的文件夹已被删除，“磁盘”不再打开一个没有说明的空白页面，而是回到卷列表。空文件夹现在会说明自己是空的。";
"Image" = "图片";
"In the light theme the icon shape and size previews were drawn white on a white card — a control the colour of its own background. They are drawn in the appearance they are shown in now, and so are the keyboard badge previews beside them." = "浅色主题下，图标形状与大小的预览在白色卡片上以白色绘制。现在它们按所处的外观绘制。";
"In use" = "使用中";
"Include subfolders" = "包含子文件夹";
"Indefinite" = "无限期";
"Install" = "安装";
"Install Homebrew" = "安装 Homebrew";
"Installed" = "已安装";
"Installing…" = "安装中…";
"It leaves terminals and password managers alone, stops while the system is in secure input, and never writes down what you type. Every change can be undone with a shortcut, and you can list words and apps it must not touch." = "它不碰终端和密码管理器，系统进入安全输入时暂停，且从不记录你输入的内容。每次修改都可用快捷键撤销，也可列出不得改动的词与应用。";
"Its system extension is still active — turn it off in Login Items & Extensions." = "该应用的系统扩展仍在运行 — 请在“登录项与扩展”中关闭。";
"Keep Awake" = "保持唤醒";
"Keep Awake module: manual, timed or automatic (external display, power, chosen apps), closed-lid mode, battery guard, global hotkey." = "保持唤醒模块：手动、定时或自动（外接显示器、电源、指定应用）、合盖模式、电池保护、全局快捷键。";
"Keep Awake’s status figures update as things happen instead of freezing at whatever they were when the page opened." = "“保持唤醒”的状态数字会实时更新，不再停留在打开页面时的数值。";
"Keep Awake’s ⋯ controls open inline with animation: custom timer with a durations menu, automation toggles, Stop button in the countdown." = "⋯ 控件在卡片内动画展开：自定义计时（时长菜单）、自动化开关、倒计时中的停止按钮。";
"Keep the Mac from falling asleep" = "阻止 Mac 进入睡眠";
"Keep these files" = "保留这些文件";
"Keyboard" = "键盘";
"Keyboard can show its own language indicator in the menu bar, with the choices the system’s one does not offer: letters plain, on a badge or in a frame, or a flag, at the size you pick, with a menu of your layouts. Off until you turn it on, since macOS shows its own." = "“键盘”可在菜单栏显示自己的语言指示器，提供系统版本没有的选项：字母、填充、描边，或旗帜（表情／绘制），尺寸可选，并带布局菜单。默认关闭。";
"Keyboard is one gesture now. Tap the key — right ⌘ unless you change it — and Helm fixes what is in front of you: the selected text if there is any, otherwise the last word, and tapping again puts it back. There were five shortcuts to set up and none of them was set. Any modifier can be the key — right or left — and on Macs with a 🌐︎ key, that too. Transliteration and changing case are gone: transliteration could not be undone reliably, and macOS already changes case in the Edit menu." = "“键盘”现在只有一个手势。敲一下按键（默认右 ⌘），Helm 就修正你眼前的东西：有选中文本就改选区，否则改上一个词，再敲一次还原。此前要设置五个快捷键，而且一个都没设。转写和改变大小写已移除。";
"Keyboard now fixes short words. Words of two or three letters were left alone on purpose — a spell checker will call almost any pair of letters a word, so asking one was worse than not asking. The most common mistyped words are exactly that short, so Helm now knows a list of them by heart and converts only when it recognises the result and does not recognise what you typed." = "“键盘”现在也能修正短词。两三个字母的词此前被刻意跳过：拼写检查几乎会把任何字母组合都算作单词，问它还不如不问。而最常打错布局的恰恰是这些短词，因此 Helm 直接记住了一份常用短词表，只有当它认得转换结果、又不认得你输入的内容时才会转换。";
"Keyboard: a word typed in the wrong keyboard layout is fixed as you type — ghbdtn becomes привет — and the input source follows. Only when the word is not a word as typed and is one once swapped, so anything valid is left alone." = "“键盘”：用错误布局输入的单词会在输入时被修正，输入法也随之切换。仅当按原样不是单词、转换后才是单词时才处理。";
