"Login Items & Extensions now lists system extensions themselves — what they are, whose they are, and which ones outlived the app that installed them." = "“登录项与扩展”现在会列出系统扩展本身：它们是什么、属于谁，以及哪些在原应用被删除后仍然留着。";
"Login Items & Extensions: see everything that loads with your Mac, marked as in use, system, or leftover — and remove the leftovers." = "登录项与扩展：查看随 Mac 一起加载的所有项目，标记为使用中、系统或残留——并删除残留项。";
"Login items can be switched off instead of only deleted. Helm uses the same list macOS itself uses, so the choice survives a reboot, needs no password, and can be undone here or in System Settings." = "登录项现在可以关闭，而不只是删除。Helm 使用 macOS 自身的列表：重启后依然有效，无需密码，可随时恢复。";
