"Move up" = "上移";
"Moving around the disk ring is one movement now. Going back up more than one level used to change the screen without animating at all, the ring travels for longer the further it goes, and the slight overshoot at the end of each move — which read as a snap — is gone." = "在磁盘环形图中移动现在是一个连贯的动作：向上跨越多层时之前完全没有动画。";
"Name" = "名称";
"Name pattern" = "名称模板";
