"Nothing Helm runs can hang. Homebrew, the VPN list and the power settings could stop forever, taking the screen waiting for them with them." = "Helm 运行的东西不会再卡死。Homebrew、VPN 列表和电源设置此前可能永远停住，并拖住等待它们的界面。";
"Nothing in this folder matches yet." = "目前这个文件夹里没有匹配的内容。";
"Nothing in this folder." = "这个文件夹里没有内容。";
