"Orange" = "橙色";
"Other" = "其他";
"Outside the folders Helm may clean — Helm did not touch it." = "不在 Helm 可清理的文件夹内 — Helm 未做任何改动。";
"Panel" = "面板";
"Panel toggles show the real state right after launch." = "启动后面板开关即显示真实状态。";
"Panels and cards now look the same on every screen: one border-free container, and the figures at the top of a module line up with the settings below them." = "面板与卡片在所有页面统一：单一无边框容器，顶部数字与下方设置对齐。";
"Paused" = "已暂停";
"Paused — a password field is in front, and Helm never reads one." = "已暂停——前面是密码框，而 Helm 从不读取密码框。";
"Per-app automation" = "按应用自动化";
"Per-app rules read as one line each: the app, when the rule applies, and nothing else. Both Keep Awake and VPN." = "按应用的规则各占一行：应用、生效时机，别无其他。“保持唤醒”与 VPN 均是如此。";
"Permissions" = "权限";
"Permissions are called what System Settings calls them, so the row Helm points you at is the row you find." = "权限名称与系统设置一致，Helm 指向的那一行就能找到。";
"Permissions at a glance: Settings shows whether Helm has Full Disk Access and lists installed system extensions. When a file can’t be removed, Helm names the reason and links to the right setting." = "权限一目了然：设置中显示 Helm 是否拥有完全磁盘访问权限，并列出系统扩展。文件无法删除时，Helm 会说明原因并跳转到相应设置。";
"Pick a folder and Helm will read what is in it, comparing content rather than names." = "选择一个文件夹，Helm 会读取其中内容并比较内容而非文件名。";
"Pick a volume, or scan any folder." = "选择宗卷，或扫描任意文件夹。";
"Pink" = "粉色";
"Pinned" = "已固定";
"Play a sound when a word is fixed" = "修正时播放提示音";
"Plug-ins" = "插件";
"Point Helm at a folder and give it rules. A file that arrives is checked against them in order and the first match wins — and every watched folder is checked again once an hour, so age rules come round." = "指定一个文件夹并为它设定规则。新到的文件按顺序检查，第一条匹配的生效；每小时还会把文件夹重新过一遍，所以“早于”这类规则也会轮到。";
"Power" = "电源";
"Press keys…" = "请按下按键…";
"Purple" = "紫色";
"Putting the app back from the Trash will not bring these files back." = "把 App 从废纸篓放回原处，这些文件不会一并恢复。";
"Quick Look" = "快速查看";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Quit the running apps first, or allow a force quit." = "请先退出运行中的应用，或允许强制退出。";
"Quitting Helm — or deleting it — could leave the Mac unable to sleep, because the clamshell setting Keep Awake changes outlives the app and nothing put it back on quit. And turning clamshell off while Keep Awake’s admin prompt was still up could leave a passwordless rule behind for a feature you’d just switched off. Both are fixed." = "退出 Helm——甚至删除它——都可能让 Mac 无法进入睡眠，因为“保持唤醒”为合盖模式所做的系统设置会在应用退出后依然存在，退出时并没有把它还原。而且，在“保持唤醒”的管理员密码提示还开着时关闭合盖选项，可能会为一个你刚关闭的功能留下一条无需密码的规则。这两个问题都已修复。";
"Quitting an app now disconnects only a VPN Helm itself raised for it — never one you dialled up by hand." = "退出应用时，只会断开 Helm 为它建立的 VPN，绝不会断开你手动连接的。";
"Reading files…" = "正在读取文件…";
"Reading the package list…" = "正在读取软件包列表…";
"Recommendations" = "建议";
"Red" = "红色";
"Redesigned About: the icon sits in a bezel that turns while updates are checked, version and build read as instrument dials, and update controls live in one card." = "重新设计“关于”：图标置于检查更新时旋转的表圈中，版本与构建如仪表读数，更新控件集中在一张卡片。";
"Refresh list" = "刷新列表";
"Removal stopped — nothing more was moved." = "移除已停止 — 未再移动任何内容。";
"Remove" = "移除";
"Remove an app with all of its files" = "连同全部文件一起删除应用";
"Removing an app no longer offers another app’s files. Leftovers were matched by the start of a bundle id and never checked against what is installed — and an app kept one folder down, or one that simply claimed somebody else’s id, could still slip past that check. Nothing from another app is offered pre-ticked now." = "卸载一个应用不会再列出另一个应用的文件。现在不会再预先勾选任何其他应用的内容。";
"Removing…" = "删除中…";
"Rename" = "重命名";
"Renaming scheme" = "重命名方式";
"Review" = "查看";
"Reset" = "重置";
"Reset all settings, in Settings → Settings. Helm goes back to how it was just after installing: preferences forgotten, each module’s saved state and the diagnostics log in the Trash — not deleted outright, so you can get them back — and the welcome tour again at the next launch. Access you granted in System Settings is macOS’s and is left alone." = "在设置 → “设置”中可以重置所有设置。Helm 会回到刚安装完的状态；已保存的内容会移到废纸篓，而不是直接删除。你在系统设置中授予的权限不受影响。";
"Reset all settings?" = "要重置所有设置吗？";
"Reset all settings…" = "重置所有设置…";
"Reset and Restart" = "重置并重启";
"Reworked icon pickers with real-size previews; smaller icon sizes." = "重做的图标选择器（实际尺寸预览）；新增更小尺寸。";
"Right ⇧" = "右 ⇧";
"Right ⌃" = "右 ⌃";
"Right ⌘" = "右 ⌘";
"Right ⌥" = "右 ⌥";
"Ring" = "圆环";
"Ring + dot" = "圆环+点";
"Rules for specific apps" = "针对特定应用的规则";
"Rules run top to bottom and the first match wins — a file gets one action, not several." = "规则自上而下执行，第一条匹配的生效——一个文件只会发生一件事，不会连续发生多件。";
"Run now" = "立即运行";
"Running" = "运行中";
"Saved windows" = "保存的窗口";
"Scan" = "扫描";
"Scan a folder…" = "扫描文件夹…";
"Scan again" = "重新扫描";
"Scan for leftovers" = "扫描残留文件";
"Scan to see what apps left behind." = "扫描以查看应用留下了什么。";
"Scanning" = "正在扫描";
"Scanning…" = "扫描中…";
"Search" = "搜索";
"Search again" = "重新搜索";
"Search stopped — the folder was not read to the end." = "搜索已停止 — 文件夹未读取到末尾。";
"Search apps" = "搜索应用";
"Search now" = "搜索";
"Search packages" = "搜索软件包";
"Searching…" = "正在搜索…";
"Select all" = "全选";
"Set" = "设置";
"Settings" = "设置";
"Settings are ordered by how often you need them — what Helm looks like first, permissions and diagnostics last — and Keep Awake keeps all four of its automatic rules in one place." = "设置按使用频率排列——外观在前，权限与诊断在后；“保持唤醒”的四条自动规则也归为一处。";
"Settings files" = "设置文件";
"Settings window polish: larger window for utility pages, macOS 26-style lists, clearer wording throughout." = "设置窗口打磨：实用工具使用更大窗口、macOS 26 风格列表、更清晰的文案。";
"Settings…" = "设置…";
"Shortcuts" = "快捷键";
"Show" = "显示";
"Show Quit button" = "显示“退出”按钮";
"Show Settings button" = "显示“设置”按钮";
"Show in Finder" = "在访达中显示";
"Show it in the menu bar" = "在菜单栏中显示";
"Show remaining time in the menu bar" = "在菜单栏显示剩余时间";
"Show what is marked for removal" = "查看已标记为待删除的项目";
"Silent in-app updates: Update & Relaunch downloads, installs and restarts with no Gatekeeper prompt." = "静默更新：“更新并重启”自动下载、安装并重启，无 Gatekeeper 提示。";
"Silent update cleans up its temporary files after installing." = "静默更新安装后清理临时文件。";
"Site the file came from" = "文件的来源网站";
"Size" = "大小";
"Size in megabytes" = "大小（MB）";
"Sizes are right where they were nearly right. A file just under a round number was shown with the unit below it — \"1000 KB\" instead of \"1 MB\" — on every screen that names a size. And removing a folder now reports what the folder held, where it used to report nothing at all." = "大小显示修正：本该是“1 MB”的地方显示成“1000 KB”。删除文件夹时也会正确统计释放的空间。";
"Skip" = "跳过";
"Smaller items" = "较小的项目";
"Sort into subfolder" = "整理到子文件夹";
"Stands for" = "代表";
"Start" = "开始";
"Startup items, extensions, and what removed apps left behind" = "启动项、扩展，以及已删除应用的残留";
"Stop" = "停止";
"Stop could leave an abandoned scan’s folders sitting in the basket, above the Trash button, on a screen that no longer had anything to do with them — and emptying the basket credited the space to whichever volume you’d since picked." = "点击“停止”后，被放弃扫描的文件夹可能仍留在收纳篮里，出现在与它们已无关的界面上的废纸篓按钮上方——清空收纳篮时，释放的空间还会被计入当时选中的那个宗卷。";
"Stop removal" = "停止移除";
"Stop scan" = "停止";
"Stop stops the disk scan. Opening a folder mid-scan used to start a second one that took over, leaving the first walking the disk with nothing able to stop it and the ring flickering between the two. And the duplicate finder’s “freed” figure now counts the copies that actually leave." = "停止能真正停止磁盘扫描；重复文件的“可释放”数字按实际会删除的副本计算。";
"Stop watching" = "停止监视";
"Stopped" = "已停止";
"Stopping a disk scan keeps what it measured. It used to throw the ring away and put you back at the volume picker, after a minute of watching it grow. The tree stays now, marked as stopped — and because a folder in an unfinished scan can hold more than it shows, it is not kept for next time." = "停止磁盘扫描后，已经测量的部分会保留。以前圆环会消失并退回到宗卷选择，看着它增长的那一分钟就白费了。现在树会保留并标记为“已停止”；由于未完成的扫描中文件夹的实际大小可能大于显示值，它不会留到下一次。";
"Style" = "样式";
"Switched on, but macOS is withholding what it needs" = "已开启，但 macOS 未授予它所需的权限";
"Switching VPN off and back on could leave the tile and the settings page silently frozen, answering nothing, until Helm was relaunched." = "关闭再打开 VPN 后，图块和设置页面可能会悄悄卡死、毫无响应，直到重启 Helm 才恢复。";
"Switching to another module and back no longer throws away what you were doing. The Uninstaller used to lose every tick, the whole review step, and the record of what macOS had refused, the moment you left its page; Login Items & Extensions restarted its scan — the slowest one in the app — the same way. Both remember now." = "切换到其他模块再切回来，不会再丢掉你正在做的事情了。以前，卸载器一旦离开页面，就会丢失所有勾选、整个审阅步骤，以及 macOS 拒绝了哪些内容的记录；“登录项与扩展”——应用里最慢的一项扫描——也会以同样的方式重新开始。现在两者都会记住。";
"System" = "系统";
"System extensions" = "系统扩展";
"Tag" = "标签";
"Tag name" = "标签名称";
"Terminals and password managers are left alone: there, a wrong-looking word is often exactly right." = "终端和密码管理器不受影响：在那里，看起来奇怪的词往往正是对的。";
"The Accessibility permission was described as only nudging the pointer for Keep Awake — it’s also what lets the Keyboard module read what you type, in every application, and the caption names both now. The first-launch alert no longer says permissions need granting “again” when none have been granted yet, and Settings no longer asks for a permission none of your enabled modules need." = "此前“辅助功能”权限只被说成是“保持唤醒”移动指针所需——实际上它也是“键盘”模块在任何应用中读取输入内容所需的权限，说明文字现在会同时提及两者。首次启动的提示不会再在从未授权的情况下说需要“重新”授权，“设置”也不会再要求已启用模块都不需要的权限。";
"The Disk ring now shows Chinese folder names the way Finder does. “Applications” and “Users” stayed in English inside an otherwise Chinese ring." = "“磁盘”环形图现在会像访达一样显示中文文件夹名称。此前原本是中文的环形图里，“Applications”“Users”仍是英文。";
"The Keyboard gesture no longer acts at the wrong place after an arrow key. Undoing already knew the caret had moved on; converting a word didn’t, and could still retype six characters wherever the caret ended up." = "按下方向键后，键盘手势不会再作用到错误的位置。撤销此前已经能识别光标已移动；但转换单词一直不能，仍可能在光标移到的新位置重新键入六个字符。";
"The Uninstaller’s last screen before deleting now names the app itself, not only its leftover files. Homebrew says plainly that its removal skips the Trash and can’t be undone — it’s the one deletion in Helm that really is permanent. Duplicates now confirms with the same count, size and named paths as Disk, and Disk’s advice about an old file now cites the date it was last written rather than calling it “untouched”. Safari is marked as a system app rather than offered for removal at “0 B”." = "卸载器删除前的最后一屏现在会写明应用本身，而不仅是它的残留文件。Homebrew 会明确说明它的删除会跳过废纸篓、且无法撤销——这是 Helm 中唯一真正不可逆的删除。“重复文件”现在会像“磁盘”一样，以相同的数量、大小和具体路径来确认；“磁盘”对旧文件的建议也改为引用最后写入日期，而不再称其“未被触碰”。Safari 会被标记为系统应用，而不是以“0 B”的大小被提供删除。";
"The VPN dial counted connections that had started themselves automatically, sitting right above the list of rules it looked like it was counting. Login Items & Extensions’ bottom bar mixed how many items were found with the size of what you’d selected." = "VPN 表盘统计的是自动连接的数量，而它正上方却是看起来应该被统计的规则列表。“登录项与扩展”底部栏把“找到的数量”和“已选中的大小”混在了一起。";
"The app itself — always removed" = "应用本体 — 总是会被删除";
"The battery guard — which stops Keep Awake from running a session down to empty — now starts on for new installs, at 20%. It shipped off by default, beside a session length that defaults to indefinite." = "电池保护功能——防止“保持唤醒”把电量耗到底——现在新安装时默认在 20% 处开启。此前它默认是关闭的，而紧挨着它的时长设置默认却是“无限期”。";
"The disk is full. Moving to the Trash needs room, because the Trash is a folder on the same disk — empty it and try again." = "磁盘已满。废纸篓就在同一块磁盘上，所以移入也需要空间——请先清倒废纸篓再试。";
"The disk list can be walked from the keyboard: arrow keys between rows, Return to go into a folder, ⌘↑ to come back out. And the screen now fits the width it has: on a narrow window the ring gives way to the list, which carries the same facts in less room." = "磁盘列表现在可以用键盘浏览：方向键移动，Return 进入文件夹，⌘↑ 返回上层。上方的栏也重新放得下了——扫描信息移到了环形图下方。";
"The disk map now answers VoiceOver: every wedge reads its name, its size and its share of the folder, and can be opened from there. Folders in the list beside it can be opened from the context menu too — the double-click still works and is no longer the only way." = "磁盘分布图现在支持 VoiceOver：每个扇区会读出名称、大小和占比，并可从那里打开。旁边列表中的文件夹也能通过右键菜单打开。";
"The disk ring grows into the folder you opened. It shows three levels at a time, and the level that arrived when you drilled in used to appear all at once at the end of the animation. Now it slides in with the rest." = "磁盘环形图会平滑地生长到你打开的文件夹：第三层不再在动画结束时突然出现。";
"The disk ring was measuring the wrong thing when you scanned a folder: it drew the volume’s free space alongside the folder’s contents, so a small folder came out as a blank grey circle. And “Scan again” now scans the same place again instead of sending you back to the volume list. In the duplicate finder, files that refused to move stay ticked, so you can fix the reason and try again without starting over. Homebrew search puts the name you typed first." = "扫描文件夹时，磁盘环把整个卷的可用空间和文件夹内容画在一起，小文件夹就成了一个空白的灰圈。“重新扫描”现在会重新扫描同一位置。重复文件查找中，未能移动的文件保持勾选。Homebrew 搜索会把你输入的名称排在最前。";
"The disk this is on is read-only. Eject it and unlock it, or copy what you need elsewhere." = "所在磁盘是只读的。请推出并解除锁定，或把需要的内容复制到别处。";
"The download did not match what the release published, so Helm did not install it." = "下载的文件与该版本公布的内容不符，因此 Helm 没有安装它。";
"The duplicate finder is its own screen now, right after Disk. It used to search whatever folder the ring happened to be showing, so you could only look where you had already scanned; now you point it at a folder and it remembers it. It still compares content rather than names, still keeps one copy of every group, and still never offers a hard link." = "重复文件查找现在是独立的一页，紧跟在“磁盘”之后。过去它只能搜索环形图当前显示的文件夹，现在由你指定文件夹，并且会记住。仍然比较内容而非文件名，每组也仍然保留一份。";
"The duplicate finder no longer holds on to everything it reads, so the memory a scan uses follows the size of a slice rather than the size of the folder. Memory is also handed back to macOS when a scan finishes and when a module is switched off." = "重复文件查找不再保留它读取的全部内容：内存占用随一小片的大小增长，而不是随文件夹大小增长。扫描结束和关闭模块时也会将内存交还系统。";
"The file is locked, or you are not its owner. Open Get Info in the Finder to unlock it or change its permissions." = "文件已锁定，或不属于你。在访达中打开“显示简介”解锁，或修改其权限。";
"The icon is white when idle and takes on the colour of whichever module is active." = "空闲时图标为白色；某个模块工作时会显示该模块的颜色。";
"The icon shape, icon size and both colours can be chosen from the keyboard, and Escape leaves the shortcut recorder." = "图标形状、大小和两种颜色都可用键盘选择，Esc 可退出快捷键录制。";
"The log Helm keeps for troubleshooting no longer writes down the names of your VPN connections, your apps, or the path to your home folder." = "用于排查问题的日志不再记录你的 VPN 连接名称、应用名称和个人文件夹路径。";
"The log records what Helm did, not what you have: app names, VPN names and paths are replaced before anything is written." = "日志记录的是 Helm 做了什么，而不是你有什么：应用名称、VPN 名称和路径在写入前都会被替换。";
"The menu-bar countdown ticks reliably, and heavy work no longer freezes the app." = "菜单栏倒计时稳定走动，繁重任务也不再让 App 卡死。";
"The module order you set is now used everywhere — the panel, the sidebar in Settings, and the icon’s menu — and it no longer gets lost when a drag is abandoned." = "你设置的模块顺序现在在各处生效——面板、设置侧边栏和图标菜单——并且中断拖动也不会丢失。";
"The panel no longer jumps or slides when sections expand; settings stay in sync between the panel and the Settings window." = "展开区块时面板不再跳动；面板与设置窗口的设置保持同步。";
"The slower update channel is called Beta, not Stable. Helm has not reached 1.0, and nothing shipped so far has earned the word stable — the app says Beta on its About page for the same reason." = "较慢的更新通道改名为“测试版”，不再叫“稳定版”。Helm 尚未到 1.0——“关于”页面也因此标注了测试版。";
"The small labels above each module’s figures are legible again, in both light and dark." = "各模块数字上方的小标签重新变得清晰，浅色与深色模式皆是。";
"The update status no longer claims you are current when no check has run — it shows when the last check happened." = "未执行检查时不再声称已是最新，而是显示上次检查时间。";
"Then" = "则";
"This app is not signed — this rule never fires" = "此应用未签名，此规则不会生效";
"This is a key you type with. It still works normally when held or combined, but a stray tap on its own will fix the last word." = "这是你打字时会用到的键。按住或组合使用时一切照常，但不小心单独敲一下就会修正上一个词。";
"This is the real thing, not a demonstration: it works here exactly as it does anywhere else." = "这是真实的输入框，不是演示：它在这里的行为和在别处完全一样。";
"This release published no checksum. Helm opened its download page instead." = "此版本未发布校验和。Helm 已打开其下载页面。";
"Timer" = "计时器";
"Timing" = "时机";
"Toggle Keep Awake" = "开关“保持唤醒”";
"Tools for your Mac" = "给你的 Mac 的一套工具";
"Try again" = "重试";
"Try it" = "试一试";
"Turn off" = "关闭";
"Turn on" = "打开";
"Turn on before reporting a problem. The file lives in ~/Library/Logs/Helm." = "报告问题前请开启。文件位于 ~/Library/Logs/Helm。";
"Turn the rule on" = "开启规则";
"Turning a login item off no longer clears everything else you had ticked." = "关闭某个登录项时，不再清空你已勾选的其他项。";
"Turning off \"stay awake with the lid closed\" now also removes the passwordless permission it had to install. It used to stay on your Mac for good." = "关闭“合盖仍保持唤醒”时，会一并移除为此安装的免密码权限。此前它会永久留在你的 Mac 上。";
"Two modules have shorter names: Disk Space is now Disk, and the layout switcher is now Keyboard." = "两个模块改用更短的名称：“磁盘空间”现为“磁盘”，布局切换器现为“键盘”。";
"Type a name and press Return." = "输入名称并按回车。";
"Type ghbdtn and press space" = "输入 ghbdtn 后按空格";
"Type ghbdtn in the wrong layout and it becomes привет, with the input source switching to match." = "用错布局输入 ghbdtn，它会变成 привет，输入法也随之切换。";
"Uninstall" = "卸载";
"Uninstaller" = "卸载器";
"Unknown" = "未知";
"Unreadable" = "无法读取";
"Untitled rule" = "未命名规则";
"Update & Relaunch" = "更新并重启";
"Update channel" = "更新通道";
"Update channels: stay on finished releases, or switch to Dev in About to get early builds first." = "更新通道：停留在正式版本，或在“关于”切换到 Dev 优先获取早期构建。";
"Update channels: stay on finished releases, or switch to Dev in About to get early builds." = "更新通道：可停留在正式版本，或在“关于”中切换到 Dev 获取早期构建。";
"Update check moved into About." = "更新检查移至“关于”。";
"Update failed" = "更新失败";
"Update ready" = "有可用更新";
"Updates" = "更新";
"Upgrade" = "升级";
"Upgrade all" = "全部升级";
"Use this module" = "使用此模块";
"Utilities" = "实用工具";
"Utilities live in a collapsible panel section; optional Settings and Quit buttons; the right-click menu jumps straight to any module." = "实用工具收纳于面板可折叠区；可选“设置/退出”按钮；右键菜单直达任意模块。";
"VERSION" = "版本";
"VPN" = "VPN";
"VPN module: connect and disconnect system VPNs with per-app auto-connect rules." = "VPN 模块：连接/断开系统 VPN，支持按应用自动连接。";
"VPN rows no longer show an endless spinner: the status is re-checked until the connection settles." = "VPN 行不再无限转圈：状态会持续复查直到连接稳定。";
"Value to match" = "要匹配的值";
"Video" = "视频";
"VoiceOver can find Helm in the menu bar, and \"Reduce motion\" is respected throughout." = "VoiceOver 能在菜单栏中找到 Helm，且全程遵循“减弱动态效果”。";
"VoiceOver reads Helm properly: every icon button has a name, and a collapsed section is no longer read out." = "VoiceOver 能正确朗读 Helm：每个图标按钮都有名称，折叠的区块不再被读出。";
"Warning and success colours, and the numbers in a metric strip, are legible in light appearance now, and the metric strip no longer occasionally reads the wrong appearance and darkens dark mode’s own colours to match." = "警告色和成功色，以及指标条中的数字，在浅色外观下现在清晰可读；指标条也不会再偶尔误读外观、把深色模式本身的颜色进一步调暗了。";
"Warnings" = "警告";
"Warnings are legible in the light theme, the icon and colour swatches can be reached from the keyboard, and sizes and names follow macOS in every language — Russian abbreviates the byte the way the Finder does, French writes a lowercase ko, and each screen calls a permission by the name Settings gives it." = "浅色主题下的警告清晰可读，图标与颜色色块可用键盘抵达，尺寸和名称在每种语言下都与 macOS 一致。";
"Website data" = "网站数据";
"Welcome to Helm" = "欢迎使用 Helm";
"What could be deleted" = "可删除的内容";
"What is taking up space" = "磁盘空间被什么占用";
"What to check" = "检查什么";
"What to do" = "做什么";
"What to show" = "显示内容";
"What would happen" = "会发生什么";
"What’s New" = "新增内容";
"When" = "当";
"When Return is pressed" = "按下 Return 键时";
"When Space is pressed" = "按下空格键时";
"When a VPN rule fires, the menu bar can say so. A tunnel a rule raised or dropped by itself changed nothing you could see. Now the connection can be named beside the icon for three seconds, or arrive as a macOS notification, or not be named at all — whichever you pick in Settings → VPN. The ring turns as well if you ask it to, in a colour you choose: one for connecting, another for dropping." = "VPN 规则自动触发时，菜单栏可以告诉你。连接名称可以在图标旁显示三秒，也可以改成 macOS 通知，或者什么都不显示。圆环也可以转动，颜色自己选：连接一种，断开另一种。";
"When a file cannot be moved, Helm now says which one and why instead of reporting success. Deleting a Homebrew package asks first, and the disk basket lists what is in it before it goes to the Trash." = "文件无法移动时，Helm 会说明是哪一个、为什么，而不是报告成功。卸载 Homebrew 包会先确认，磁盘收集篮会列出其内容。";
"When a file will not move, Helm now says why on every screen that removes things. Disk and the duplicate finder used to give you a count and leave you to guess — usually the answer was Full Disk Access, which is one click away once you know. Quiet text is also readable again: the captions and secondary lines were fainter than they were meant to be." = "当文件无法移动时，Helm 现在会在每个执行删除的页面说明原因。“磁盘”和重复文件查找过去只给一个数字，而答案通常是完全磁盘访问权限。次要文字的深浅也调回了可读的程度。";
"When a punctuation mark is typed" = "输入标点时";
"When a rule connects" = "规则连接时";
"When a rule fires" = "规则生效时";
"When a tunnel goes down" = "隧道断开时";
"When to fix" = "何时修正";
"Which conditions must match" = "需要满足哪些条件";
"White" = "白色";
"Window" = "窗口";
"With an external display" = "连接外接显示器时";
"Without Full Disk Access Helm cannot check every item, and a short list of leftovers looks exactly like a Mac with none." = "没有完全磁盘访问权限时，Helm 无法检查全部项目；残留项少和没有残留看起来一模一样。";
"Without Full Disk Access Helm cannot read every folder, and a short list of duplicates looks exactly like a folder that has none." = "没有完全磁盘访问权限时，Helm 无法读取全部文件夹；结果少和没有重复看起来一模一样。";
"Without Full Disk Access a protected folder reads as empty: no rule matches, and that looks exactly like a folder with nothing to do." = "没有完全磁盘访问权限时，受保护的文件夹会被读成空的：没有规则匹配，而这看起来和一个无事可做的文件夹一模一样。";
"A rule can watch folders inside your home folder, but not the Library and not a whole volume." = "规则可以监视个人文件夹内的文件夹，但不能监视资源库或整个宗卷。";
"Watch this folder" = "监视此文件夹";
"Without Full Disk Access an app’s containers stay behind, and Helm cannot see the Trash to look for leftovers." = "没有完全磁盘访问权限，App 的容器会残留，Helm 也看不到废纸篓、无法查找残留文件。";
"Without Full Disk Access an app’s containers stay behind." = "没有完全磁盘访问权限时，应用的容器会残留。";
"Without Full Disk Access some folders scan as empty." = "没有完全磁盘访问权限时，部分文件夹会显示为空。";
"Wording and sizes reviewed across the app: shorter labels, one name per thing, and sizes in your language — “432,95 ГБ”, not “432,95 GB”." = "全应用文案与大小显示梳理：标签更简短、同一事物统一称呼、大小按你的语言显示。";
"Write a log file" = "记录日志";
"Yellow" = "黄色";
