"All three are also in the menu-bar icon’s right-click menu." = "这三项也都在菜单栏图标的右键菜单里。";
"Edit panel" = "编辑面板";
"Editing the panel" = "正在编辑面板";
"Nothing on this tab yet" = "此标签页还是空的";
"Press the pencil below to add a widget." = "点按下方的铅笔即可添加小组件。";
"Right-click the menu-bar icon to add a widget." = "右键点按菜单栏图标即可添加小组件。";
"Widgets are moved by hand. Pick one up and it follows the pointer; the others slide aside; letting go sets it down where the space opened." = "小组件可以直接用手挪动：拿起一个，它会跟着指针走，其他小组件让开，松手后它落在空出的位置。";
"About Helm says who wrote it, with a way to reach him." = "“关于 Helm”写明了作者，并提供联系方式。";
"The panel is arranged in the panel. “Edit panel” in its footer: give a widget one of three sizes, take one off, add one from the gallery, make a tab. Keep Awake, VPN, Autopilot, Disk and Keyboard come in more than one size, and Disk shows how much of the disk is still free." = "面板就在面板里编排。底部的“编辑面板”：给小组件选三种尺寸之一、移除、从图库添加、新建标签页。“保持唤醒”、VPN、“自动整理”、“磁盘”和“键盘”支持不止一种尺寸，“磁盘”还会显示磁盘还剩多少可用空间。";
"Light, dark or automatic is three pictures now, not a menu of three words — the way macOS asks the same question." = "浅色、深色或自动现在是三张图片，而不是三个词的菜单 — 与 macOS 提出同一问题的方式一致。";
"Settings says what is missing before you scroll: a line at the top counts the permissions macOS is withholding and the modules they reach." = "设置在你滚动之前就说明缺少什么：顶部一行统计 macOS 未授予的权限以及受影响的模块。";
"One arrangement for everything. The order and sections you compose now decide the panel as well, not just the window’s sidebar." = "一套排列。你编排的顺序与分组现在也决定面板，而不只是窗口边栏。";
"The menu-bar icon has six shapes and three sizes — S, M and L. The shape menu draws each one at the size you chose, so what you see is what the bar gets." = "菜单栏图标有六种形状和三种尺寸（S、M、L）。形状菜单按所选尺寸绘制，所见即菜单栏所得。";
"Pressing “Move to Trash” twice no longer says the first removal failed. The files had already gone, and in Disk the folders that had left were still drawn on the ring." = "再次点击“移到废纸篓”不再报告第一次删除失败：文件已经移走；而在“磁盘”里，已经移走的文件夹仍画在环上。";
"The Uninstaller counts a file removed together with the folder it was in. The file did go to the Trash — it was only missing from the report, so a removal of four things said three." = "卸载器会计入随所在文件夹一起删除的文件。该文件确实已进入废纸篓，只是没有写进报告，删除四项时只报告三项。";
"The Uninstaller no longer overstates how much a removal moved to the Trash: two names for one file were counted as two files." = "卸载器不再夸大删除释放的空间：同一个文件的两个名字此前按两个文件计算。";
"Removing an app that is still running waits for it to quit. Helm used to move the bundle anyway, so a slow app carried on and wrote its settings back on the way out — putting back the leftovers that had just been taken." = "删除仍在运行的应用会等待它退出。此前 Helm 照样移动程序包，应用继续运行并在退出时把设置写了回来，把刚清理掉的残留又放了回去。";
"A switch no longer shows “off” for a module that is already running." = "开关不再对已经在运行的模块显示“关闭”。";
"The Homebrew console keeps the last thousand lines instead of every line it has ever printed." = "Homebrew 控制台保留最近一千行，而不是曾经打印的全部内容。";
"Clearing Caches works now — it could never be carried out before. The contents are cleared and the folder stays, in one row and one press as before. Whatever a running app is holding on to stays with it, listed by name, and the row shrinks to what is left." = "现在可以清理 Caches 了 — 以前这条建议从来无法执行。清理的是内容，文件夹保留，仍是一行、一次点击。正在运行的 App 占用的部分会留下并逐项列出，该行也会缩减为剩下的部分。";
"“Show in Finder” opens the folder a file was in when the file itself is gone, and brings Finder forward. It sits beside a file that would not move, beside something Autopilot moved, beside a leftover deleted a moment ago — and in all but one of those places, pressing it did nothing." = "“在访达中显示”会在文件本身已不存在时打开它原来所在的文件夹，并把访达切到前台。这个按钮就在无法移动的文件旁、在自动整理刚移走的东西旁、在刚删除的残留旁 — 而除了一处之外，按下去毫无反应。";
"The sidebar is yours to arrange. Settings → Settings → Sidebar: press Edit and drag a module anywhere — including into a section you made and named yourself. Delete a section and its modules go to the neighbour, never into nothing; “Restore defaults” puts back the arrangement Helm arrived with. The window and the menu-bar icon show the same arrangement, and it survives a restart and an update." = "侧边栏由你排列。设置 → 设置 → 侧边栏：点“编辑”，把模块拖到任何地方，包括你自己新建并命名的分组。删除分组时，其中的模块会移到相邻分组；“恢复默认”可以还原。窗口和菜单栏图标的菜单显示同一种排列，重启和更新后依然保留。";
"Small tidying in Settings. Rows in the Uninstaller are all one height — the “System” mark is a tag beside the name instead of a third line. Login Items no longer says the same thing in two stacked bars. And every size, count and version in the app is in the one typeface Helm keeps for figures." = "设置里的小整理。“卸载器”的每一行现在等高：“系统”标记成了名称旁的标签，而不是第三行。“登录项”不再用上下两条相同的横栏说同一件事。应用里所有的大小、计数和版本号，都用 Helm 专为数字保留的那一种字体。";
"Drag an app to the Trash and Helm offers to clear up after it, a second later — once you switch it on under Uninstaller → Leftovers. The app stays where you put it, and Helm lists the settings, caches and support files it left behind, already ticked; anything matched only by the app’s name arrives unticked. Say no and it does not ask about that app again." = "把 App 移到废纸篓，Helm 会立刻提出替你清理——需先在“卸载”→“残留”里打开。App 留在原处，它留下的设置、缓存和支持文件会列出来并默认勾选；仅靠名称匹配到的则不勾选。你说不，它就不会再问这个 App。";
"The welcome tour lets you pick what you want. Each module’s screen carries a switch, so you can keep or drop it while you are being introduced to it — and the opening screen asks whether Helm should start with your Mac. The switch starts where the module already stood, so skipping the tour changes nothing." = "欢迎引导现在让你挑选。每个模块的页面都有开关，第一屏会问你是否跟随 Mac 启动 Helm。开关的初始位置就是模块原有的状态，所以跳过不会改变任何东西。";
"Helm no longer asks for permissions the moment you install it. It used to request Full Disk Access and Accessibility on the very first launch, before you had asked it to do anything. Each module now asks for what it needs on its own page, when it needs it." = "Helm 不再在安装后立即索要权限。以前它会在首次启动时就请求完全磁盘访问和辅助功能权限。现在每个模块在自己的页面上按需索要。";
"Hardware" = "硬件";
"Rostislav Strelnikov" = "Rostislav Strelnikov";
"The update channel is two pills, each in its own colour — Beta in the accent, Dev in orange — so which one you follow is visible at a glance." = "更新通道是两个胶囊按钮，各有自己的颜色 — Beta 用强调色，Dev 用橙色，一眼就能看出你在哪个通道。";
"Helm no longer describes itself as a menu-bar app. It is also a panel, a settings window and a sidebar you arrange yourself, and the line under the name says so." = "Helm 不再把自己说成菜单栏应用。它也是面板、设置窗口，以及你自己编排的边栏，名称下面的那行现在就是这么说的。";
"The line Helm shows when an update check fails is readable in every language. It was cut short in five of the eight." = "检查更新失败时显示的那行字，在所有语言里都能完整读到。八种语言里有五种会被截断。";
"Helm could crash while you were typing. It no longer can." = "在你打字时，Helm 可能会崩溃。现在不会了。";
"Keyboard could stop converting words without saying so. macOS switches the keyboard watcher off when it judges an app too slow to answer; Helm now notices and turns it back on." = "“键盘”可能不再转换单词，却什么也不说。当 macOS 认为某个应用响应过慢时，会关闭键盘监视；现在 Helm 会察觉并重新开启。";
"Keep Awake could leave the Mac unable to sleep, with its own switch saying it was off." = "“保持唤醒”可能让 Mac 无法睡眠，而它自己的开关却显示已关闭。";
"Resume" = "恢复";
"The sidebar is narrower and can be dragged wider or thinner — whatever you settle on comes back next time." = "侧栏变窄了，并且可以拖动调整宽度——你选定的宽度下次仍然保留。";
"A silenced rule says so in the panel, with a way to start it again. Stopping a session by hand, or a timer that ends automation, used to leave the rule quiet with nothing saying so." = "被静音的规则会在面板里说明，并给出重新启用的按钮。手动停止，或让计时结束自动保持的开关，此前会让规则一直沉默，而且没有任何地方说明。";
"No rule is switched on" = "没有开启任何规则";
"No rule applies right now" = "目前没有规则被满足";
"Applies right now" = "当前已满足";
"So apps do not decide nobody is at the Mac" = "以免 App 认为 Mac 前面没有人";
"Until you pick one, the same as the active colour" = "未选择前，与激活时的颜色相同";
"No apps chosen" = "未选择任何 App";
"Keep Awake opens with what is happening and the buttons for it: a countdown you can add to, or four ways to start. Each rule underneath says whether it applies right now and whether it is switched on." = "“保持唤醒”以当前状态和对应按钮开场：可以加时的倒计时，或四种开始方式。下面的每条规则都会说明它当前是否满足，以及是否已开启。";
"A module’s name says whether it is running." = "模块名称旁会显示它是否正在运行。";
"A rule that is switched on and doing nothing now looks different from one that is switched off." = "已开启但没有生效的规则，现在看起来和关闭的规则不同了。";
"The Mac sleeps as usual" = "Mac 会照常睡眠";
"Not applying right now" = "当前未满足";
"Stop pauses the rule until it applies again" = "“停止”会暂停该规则，直到它再次满足";
"Paused until the rule applies again" = "已暂停，直到规则再次满足";
"Stop on low battery" = "低电量时停止";
"Stay awake with the lid closed" = "合盖后仍保持唤醒";
"Sleep is off for the whole Mac right now" = "当前整台 Mac 的睡眠已关闭";
"Sleep is off for the whole Mac right now. Switching this off turns sleep back on" = "当前整台 Mac 的睡眠已关闭。关掉此设置即可重新开启睡眠";
"macOS refused to turn sleep off, so closing the lid will let the Mac sleep. The rule in /etc/sudoers.d may have been changed" = "macOS 拒绝关闭睡眠，因此合盖后 Mac 仍会进入睡眠。/etc/sudoers.d 中的规则可能已被更改";
"The rule in /etc/sudoers.d is still there. Switch this on and off again to remove it" = "/etc/sudoers.d 中的规则仍然存在。将此设置开启后再关闭即可移除";
"Helm cannot read the saved app rules, so no app is keeping the Mac awake. Add the apps again" = "Helm 无法读取已保存的 App 规则，因此没有 App 让 Mac 保持唤醒。请重新添加这些 App";
"A timer pauses the rule too" = "计时结束也暂停规则";
"Move the pointer" = "移动指针";
"Keep the display on" = "不熄屏";
"Active icon colour" = "激活时的图标颜色";
"Timer colour" = "计时颜色";
"How long the panel's switch and the keyboard shortcut keep the Mac awake" = "面板开关和键盘快捷键让 Mac 保持唤醒的时长";
"Only while the Mac is kept awake. At other times Helm shows its shared icon" = "仅在 Mac 保持唤醒时。其余时间显示 Helm 的通用图标";
"While a timer runs, the ring empties clockwise" = "计时期间圆环会顺时针减少";
"Add an app and the Mac stays awake while it is running. You can limit a rule to power, to an external display, or to both." = "添加一个 App，它运行时 Mac 就不会睡眠。你可以把规则限定为接电源时、接外接显示器时，或两者兼有。";
"When the timer runs out, the rule is paused until it applies again" = "计时结束后，该规则会暂停，直到再次满足";
"Needs Accessibility, or the pointer will not move" = "需要“辅助功能”，否则指针不会移动";
"then the external display keeps the Mac awake" = "之后由外接显示器继续保持唤醒";
"then being on power keeps the Mac awake" = "之后由接通电源继续保持唤醒";
"then the app keeps the Mac awake" = "之后由该 App 继续保持唤醒";
"The Mac is staying awake" = "Mac 保持唤醒";
"Until you stop it" = "直到你停止";
"While an external display is connected" = "接着外接显示器时";
"While the Mac is on power" = "Mac 接着电源时";
"macOS asks for an administrator password the first time, and keeps a rule that lets Helm turn sleep off without asking again. Switching this off removes it. Quitting Helm turns sleep back on; if Helm crashes or is force-quit, the next launch turns it back on." = "首次启用时 macOS 会要求输入管理员密码，并保留一条规则，让 Helm 以后无需再询问就能关闭睡眠。关掉此设置会移除它。退出 Helm 会重新开启睡眠；若 Helm 崩溃或被强制退出，下次启动会重新开启。";
"Developer" = "开发";
"Interface language" = "界面语言";
"Dev builds only, for reading the app in a language this Mac is not set to." = "仅限 dev 版本，用于以这台 Mac 未设置的语言阅读应用。";
"System Settings" = "系统设置";
"Time remaining" = "剩余时间";
"Keep Awake takes any duration you like, in the panel and on the settings page, and every state offers “Indefinite” — so a rule can keep going after the app it watches has quit." = "Keep Awake 在面板和设置页面都能接受任意时长，每种状态下也都提供“无限期”——因此规则可以在它监视的 App 退出后继续让 Mac 保持唤醒。";
"The line about something else keeping the Mac awake is gone. It appeared whenever the screen was on and never named anything you could act on." = "“有别的东西让这台 Mac 保持唤醒”这一行已移除。只要屏幕亮着它就会出现，而且从不指出你能处理的对象。";
"A paused rule now says only that it is paused. Its row used to add “Not applying right now” underneath — two accounts of one rule on one screen." = "暂停的规则现在只说明自己已暂停。此前它那一行下方还会加上“当前不适用”——同一块屏幕对同一条规则给出两种说法。";
"Helm no longer asks for your administrator password out of the blue. With “Stay awake with the lid closed” switched on, launching a watched app could raise a system prompt when you had touched nothing. It is asked for when you start a session yourself, or when you switch the setting on." = "Helm 不会再毫无来由地索取管理员密码。开启“合盖后保持唤醒”时，启动被监视的 App 可能会在你什么都没碰的时刻弹出系统窗口。现在只有你自己开始一次会话，或打开该设置时才会询问。";
"The countdown no longer interrupts VoiceOver every second." = "倒计时不会再每秒打断 VoiceOver。";
"A timer can end automation too. Set one while an app is holding the Mac awake and it releases that as well, until the app is launched again." = "计时器也可以结束自动化。在某个 App 让 Mac 保持唤醒期间设置计时器，它会一并结束该 App——直到该 App 再次启动。";
"then the rule is paused until it applies again" = "之后规则将暂停，直到再次适用";
"Keep Awake says which app is holding the Mac, not just “App”." = "Keep Awake 会说出是哪个 App 让 Mac 保持唤醒，而不只是“App”。";
"The countdown says what happens at zero when a timer is set to end automation as well." = "当计时器被设为同时结束自动化时，倒计时会说明归零后会发生什么。";
"Filter" = "筛选";
"Rule paused" = "规则已暂停";
"Brown" = "棕色";
"Other colour…" = "其他…";
"A colour of your own: the colour menu ends with “Other…”, which opens the system colour panel — the way Calendar offers one. The palette is Calendar’s, and follows light and dark the way the system’s colours do." = "自定义颜色：颜色菜单末尾是“其他…”，会打开系统调色板——和“日历”的做法一致。调色板取自“日历”，并像系统颜色那样跟随浅色与深色。";
"“Stop on low battery” is a slider with stops, the way the charge limit is set in Battery. And the two colour rows are a dot and a name instead of two rows of ten swatches." = "“低电量时停止”改成带档位的滑块，与“电池”中的充电上限一致。两行颜色选择也从两排十个色块，变成一个圆点加名称。";
"No VPNs are set up on this Mac" = "这台 Mac 上没有配置任何 VPN";
"Open Network settings" = "打开“网络”设置";
"Helm picks it up on its own — there is nothing to refresh." = "Helm 会自动识别——无需刷新。";
"Connect" = "连接";
"Disconnect" = "断开连接";
"When a tunnel drops on its own" = "隧道自行断开时";
"VPN dropped" = "VPN 已断开";
"Connected by this rule now" = "当前由此规则连接";
"A VPN that drops on its own can be announced louder than the rules. A tunnel lost to a network change is the one thing here nobody asked for, and it used to arrive in the same words as a rule doing what it was told." = "自行断开的 VPN 可以比规则提示得更响。因网络切换而丢失的隧道是这里唯一没人要求的事，却和规则照办时用同样的措辞来通报。";
"A per-app rule says when it is holding a tunnel up right now." = "按应用的规则会显示它此刻是否正在保持隧道。";
"The VPN page lines up. The connections take the whole row and sit in the same column as everything under them, and the notice modes are picked the way light and dark are picked in General." = "VPN 页面对齐了。连接占满整行，并与下方所有内容位于同一列；提示方式的选择方式与“通用”中选择浅色和深色相同。";
"The battery guard says on screen that it stopped a session, names the setting that did it and how to lift it, and sends a notification even when you are not looking at Helm. It used to stop sessions in silence." = "电量保护会在界面上说明它结束了会话、是哪项设置导致的以及如何解除，并且即使你没有在看 Helm 也会发送通知。以前它会悄悄结束会话。";
"The lid row says when sleep is off for the whole Mac right now, and how to bring it back. It used to show only what turning the switch on would cost." = "合盖行会说明当前是否整台 Mac 的睡眠已关闭，以及如何恢复。以前它只显示打开开关的代价。";
"If macOS declines to turn system sleep off, the lid row says the Mac will sleep with the lid closed after all, instead of leaving the switch on with nothing behind it." = "如果 macOS 拒绝关闭系统睡眠，合盖行会说明合盖后 Mac 仍会进入睡眠，而不是让开关看起来已打开却毫无实际效果。";
"Helm says when it cannot read your saved app rules, and asks you to add them again. The page used to look exactly as if you had chosen no apps." = "当无法读取已保存的 App 规则时，Helm 会说明，并请你重新添加。以前页面看起来就像你根本没有选择任何 App。";
"The note about the lid’s password prompt no longer overstates what quitting Helm costs: quitting turns sleep back on right away." = "关于合盖密码提示的说明不再夸大退出 Helm 的代价：退出会立即重新开启睡眠。";
"The log’s level filter, and the Uninstaller’s and Homebrew’s pickers, no longer clip in long languages." = "日志的级别筛选器，以及卸载工具和 Homebrew 的选择器，在长文本语言下不再被裁切。";
"Permission notices look the same everywhere Helm asks for one." = "无论 Helm 在哪里请求权限，权限提示的样式现在都一致了。";
"Per-app VPN rules check which app is really running before connecting or disconnecting a tunnel, so a fake app cannot pose as a real one to raise or drop your VPN. Rules you already had need the app chosen once more — until then the row says “Choose this app again to confirm which app it is” and does nothing." = "按应用设置的 VPN 规则会在连接或断开隧道之前检查当前实际运行的是哪个应用，因此伪造的应用无法冒充真实应用来建立或掐断你的 VPN。已有的规则需要重新选择一次应用——在此之前该行会显示“请重新选择此应用以确认其身份”，且不会执行任何操作。";
"A refused VPN command is reported as refused, not as connected — and a tunnel that drops is noticed even when another VPN shares its name." = "被拒绝的 VPN 命令会如实报告为“被拒绝”，而不是“已连接”——而且即使另一个 VPN 同名，隧道断开也会被察觉。";
"The warning under the VPN notice options names the options the picker itself offers: Nothing, Menu bar, and Notification." = "VPN 通知选项下方的警告文字，现在使用与选择器本身一致的名称：“无”“菜单栏”“通知”。";
"A VPN card mid-handshake says Cancel, not Disconnect — the old word named something that had not happened yet." = "正在建立连接的 VPN 卡片显示“取消”，而不是“断开连接”——旧的措辞指的是尚未发生的事。";
"Opening Keyboard without Accessibility granted shows a plain “Helm is not watching the keyboard” instead of a page of settings that cannot work without it." = "在未授予“辅助功能”权限的情况下打开“键盘”，会直接显示“Helm 未在监视键盘”，而不是一页在没有权限时无法工作的设置。";
"If Accessibility is switched off and back on, Keyboard starts watching again on its own — it used to need Helm relaunched." = "如果关闭又重新开启“辅助功能”，“键盘”模块会自行恢复监视——以前必须重新启动 Helm。";
"A VPN rule that cannot reach its saved secret says so on the page and asks for one press of Connect. It used to stop working in silence." = "无法取用已保存密钥的 VPN 规则会在页面上说明，并请你按一次“连接”。以前它会悄悄失效。";
"Autopilot checks that a file is still where it was right before it moves, renames or bins it, and stops if the folder changed underneath the rule." = "自动整理在移动、重命名或丢进废纸篓之前会确认文件仍在原处；如果规则所在的文件夹已被换掉，就会停下。";
"Autopilot’s “already done” mark on a file is signed now, so nothing else on your Mac can put one there. Something arriving in a watched folder could mark itself as dealt with and be passed over for ever." = "文件上的“已处理”标记现在带签名，Mac 上的其他东西无法自行加上。以前，进入受监视文件夹的东西可以把自己标成已处理，从此被一直跳过。";
"Putting an older copy of Helm’s settings back no longer brings your deleted Autopilot rules with it. Helm knows which set is the current one and refuses an earlier one, saying so on the page." = "把 Helm 的设置换回旧的副本，不会再把你删掉的自动整理规则一起带回来。Helm 知道哪一套是当前的，遇到更早的会拒绝，并在页面上说明。";
"Everything found is hidden by the filter." = "找到的项目已全部被筛选条件隐藏。";
"Protected by macOS" = "受 macOS 保护";
"While you are away" = "在你离开时";
"These modules look through your files on their own — only when the Mac is idle, unlocked and on power, and no more than twice a day each." = "这些模块会自行浏览你的文件——仅在 Mac 闲置、已解锁并接通电源时，每个每天最多两次。";
"Hasn’t run yet" = "尚未运行";
"Waiting for you to allow Helm in System Settings." = "正在等待你在系统设置中允许。";
"macOS would not add Helm to your login items, so it will not open by itself." = "macOS 未将 Helm 加入登录项，因此它不会自动打开。";
"Open Login Items & Extensions…" = "打开登录项与扩展…";
"Switched off" = "已关闭";
"Put back" = "放回";
"back where it was" = "已放回原处";
"The mark that stops a rule acting twice could not be written, so the rule may take this file again within the hour." = "无法写入阻止规则重复执行的标记，规则可能在一小时内再次处理这个文件。";
"The record of what Autopilot did was not written by Helm, so nothing in it can be put back." = "自动整理的操作记录不是 Helm 写的，因此其中的任何内容都无法放回。";
"Clear the record and start again" = "清除记录并重新开始";
"it is no longer where Autopilot put it" = "它已不在自动整理放置的位置";
"something else is there now" = "那里现在是别的文件";
"the folder it came from is gone" = "它原来所在的文件夹已不存在";
"it is outside the folders a rule may reach" = "它不在规则可以触及的文件夹内";
"the old name is taken" = "原来的名称已被占用";
"it is no longer in the Trash" = "它已不在废纸篓中";
"it has already been put back" = "它已经被放回";
"this record was not written by Helm" = "这条记录不是 Helm 写的";
"Helm did not record enough to put it back" = "Helm 记录的信息不足以将其放回";
"the path changed underneath" = "路径在中途发生了变化";
"kept: by folder" = "保留原因：所在文件夹";
"kept: arrived first" = "保留原因：先出现";
"kept: the shorter path" = "保留原因：路径更短";
"kept: first alphabetically" = "保留原因：字母顺序在前";
"kept: your choice" = "保留原因：你的选择";
"your choice" = "你的选择";
"Keep this copy" = "保留这份副本";
"Restore the recommendation" = "恢复推荐选择";
"An extra copy is" = "多余的副本是指";
"the one that arrived later" = "较晚出现的那份";
"Duplicates asks which copy is the extra: the one in Downloads or on the Desktop, or the one that arrived later. Every group says why its copy was kept, any row can be made the one that stays, and “Restore the recommendation” puts that back." = "“重复文件”会先问哪一份才是多余的副本：位于“下载”或“桌面”中的那份，还是较晚出现的那份。每组都会说明为什么保留这份副本，任意一行都可以设为保留，“恢复推荐选择”可以撤回。";
"Rules to start with" = "从这些规则开始";
"Screenshots into their own folder" = "截屏放进专属文件夹";
"Downloads sorted by kind" = "下载按类型归类";
"Old installers to the Trash" = "旧安装包移到废纸篓";
"A tag on big downloads" = "给较大的下载加标记";
"Desktop sorted by month" = "桌面按月份归类";
"Nothing is being watched yet, so there is nothing to record." = "还没有监视任何文件夹，因此没有可记录的内容。";
"Every rule is switched off, so nothing will be recorded here until one is switched on." = "所有规则都已关闭，在开启任意一条之前这里不会有记录。";
"Nothing yet. A file that arrives is checked as it lands, and every watched folder is swept once an hour." = "暂时还没有。文件一到就会检查，每个受监视的文件夹每小时清理一次。";
"Subfolders are included for this folder, so this rule reaches into them too." = "该文件夹已包含子文件夹，因此这条规则也会作用到子文件夹里。";
"Show the rules to start with" = "查看可以从这里开始的规则";
"Autopilot comes with five rules you can use without writing one: screenshots into their own folder, downloads sorted by kind, old installers to the Trash, a tag on big downloads, the desktop sorted by month. Opening a rule shows what it would do to your real folder before anything is saved, and the tidying it does can be put back." = "自动整理内置五条无需自己编写的规则：截屏放进专属文件夹、下载按类型归类、旧安装包移到废纸篓、给较大的下载加标记、桌面按月份归类。打开一条规则，就能在保存任何内容之前看清它对真实文件夹会做什么；整理过的结果也可以放回。";
"The record of what Autopilot did now says why it is empty — nothing is being watched, every rule is switched off, or nothing has matched yet." = "自动整理的记录为空时，现在会说明原因：没有在监视任何文件夹、所有规则都已关闭，或者还没有匹配到任何文件。";
"Autopilot can put back what it moved, renamed, tagged or deleted — one file at a time from its own row, or a whole run at once from the report or the history below it. If a returned file’s rule could take it again within the hour, the report offers to switch that rule off." = "自动整理可以放回它移动、重命名、加标记或删除过的文件——可以从某一行单独放回一个文件，也可以从报告或下方历史记录中一次放回整批。如果放回的文件可能在一小时内又被同一条规则处理，报告会提示关闭该规则。";
"Pressing “Put back” could crash Helm outright. It no longer can." = "点按“放回”曾可能导致Helm整个崩溃。现在不会了。";
"A sorting rule no longer tries to file its own sorted folders inside themselves." = "排序规则不再尝试把自己整理出的文件夹塞进它自己里面。";
"Duplicates could find nothing at all, silently. Search is repaired, the removal banner no longer overstates the space you would free when Finder has its own clone of a file, and a removal that gets no answer says so instead of staying quiet on a second press." = "“重复文件”有时会悄无声息地什么都搜不到。搜索已修复；当 Finder 有同一文件的克隆时，删除提示条不再高估能释放的空间；删除请求没有得到回应时，会如实说明，而不是再按一次仍然毫无提示。";
"A copy you chose to keep by hand stays chosen after a removal." = "手动选定要保留的副本，在删除之后仍会保持选定。";
"Disk says when a folder is still being measured, and Stop really stops it. A file already gone by the time Disk tries to remove it gets its own message instead of sending you to look for it in the Finder, and the free-space tile on the panel updates again instead of freezing at what it read when Helm launched." = "“磁盘”会显示文件夹仍在测量中，“停止”现在真的会停止。“磁盘”要删除的文件如果早已不存在，会收到专属提示，而不是被引导去 Finder 里查找；面板上的可用空间图块也重新会更新，不再停留在 Helm 启动时读到的数值。";
"The Log page shows the log that is actually on disk, not only this session’s — yesterday’s crash used to be missing from the very page you would open to find it." = "“日志”页面显示的是磁盘上真正的日志，而不只是本次会话的日志——以前昨天的崩溃恰恰会在你打开查找它的这一页里缺失。";
"Removal, sweep and “Put back” reports are announced to VoiceOver as they appear, and the welcome tour moves VoiceOver’s focus along with each step." = "删除、扫描和“放回”的报告出现时会立即读给 VoiceOver；欢迎导览也会随每一步移动 VoiceOver 的焦点。";
"Removing duplicates shows its progress and can be stopped. “Stop removal” ends it where it is — what already moved stays in the Trash, and the report says the removal was stopped rather than failed." = "移除重复项会显示进度，并且可以停止。“停止移除”就地停下 — 已移动的仍留在废纸篓里，报告会说明移除已停止，而不是失败。";
"A Homebrew operation can be stopped, and stopping it is reported as “Stopped”, not as a failure. A brew that stops answering no longer hangs the module — Helm cuts it off and keeps the last good answer." = "Homebrew 的操作可以停止了，停止会报告为“已停止”，而不是失败。不再应答的 brew 不会再挂起模块 — Helm 会将其切断，并保留最后一次正常的应答。";
"Keyboard speaks with VoiceOver: a conversion is announced with its words, the pause at a password field and a revoked permission are announced as they happen, and the shortcut recorder reads its combination back in words. The note under the tap key warns that tapping Control on its own is also VoiceOver’s pause-speech gesture." = "键盘模块会与 VoiceOver 对话：转换连同其单词一起播报，密码框前的暂停和被撤销的权限在发生时播报，快捷键录制器会用文字读出组合。轻点键下方的说明会提醒：单独轻点 Control 也是 VoiceOver 暂停朗读的手势。";
"An Autopilot rule with a half-written condition can no longer be switched on. “Name begins with” and nothing typed matched every file in the folder — with the action set to Trash, three gestures from a blank rule were enough to endanger it. The rule is kept, switched off, for you to finish." = "条件写了一半的自动整理规则无法再开启。“名称”“开头是”而什么都没填会匹配文件夹里的每个文件 — 若动作是废纸篓，从空白规则出发三步就足以危及这个文件夹。规则会保留为关闭状态，等你写完。";
"“New rule” is a draft until you press Done. It used to be saved the moment the editor opened, so Cancel left an Untitled rule behind." = "“新建规则”在按下“完成”之前只是草稿。以前编辑器一打开就已保存，取消会留下一条“未命名规则”。";
"Autopilot’s history keeps up while you watch: a sweep or a file handled in the background appears on the open page instead of waiting for you to reopen it." = "自动整理的历史在你看着的时候就会同步：后台的一次清扫或处理过的文件会出现在打开的页面上，不必重新打开页面。";
"A folder Autopilot may never watch — a system folder, a whole disk — is refused in its own words, instead of sending you to grant Full Disk Access that would not have helped." = "自动整理永远不可监视的文件夹 — 系统文件夹、整块磁盘 — 会用它自己的话拒绝，而不是让你去授予帮不上忙的“完全磁盘访问权限”。";
"Autopilot reads big folders noticeably faster." = "自动整理读取大文件夹明显更快。";
"Undoing a Keyboard conversion puts the layout back too. The text came back but the keyboard stayed switched, so the next word came out wrong again." = "撤销键盘模块的转换也会把布局换回来。以前文字回来了，键盘却仍是切换后的 — 下一个词又打错了。";
"A word fixed by selecting it counts into the day’s figure." = "通过选中修正的词会计入当天的统计。";
"A change you rejected stays on the page with “Never this word” beside it, and the words on that list now win over the forced gesture too." = "被您拒绝的更改会留在页面上，旁边是“从不改这个词”— 而且这份名单上的词现在连强制手势也拦得住。";
"Keyboard says “Paused” while a password field is actually in front, not at the next conversion — and when all three of its switches are off, the page says so instead of looking configured." = "键盘模块在密码框确实位于前台时就显示“已暂停”，而不是等到下一次转换 — 三个开关都关闭时，页面会直说，而不是看起来已配置好。";
"Homebrew stays quiet about updates until it has an answer, instead of claiming “Updates: 0” before it has asked." = "Homebrew 在拿到答案之前对更新保持沉默，而不是在没问过时就宣称“更新 0”。";
"A pair of duplicates Helm cannot read gets its own explanation, and every refusal on the page ends by offering “Search again”." = "Helm 读不了的重复文件对会得到自己的解释，页面上的每条拒绝也都以“重新搜索”结尾。";
"A new duplicates search no longer shows the last one’s report, and a stopped search says it was stopped instead of pretending no folder was chosen." = "新的重复项搜索不再显示上一次的报告，被停止的搜索会说自己已停止，而不是装作没有选过文件夹。";
"A duplicate group’s header says what removing its extras would really free, instead of the size times the count — which promised too much whenever the copies were clones sharing their space." = "重复项组的标题会说明移除多余副本真正能腾出多少空间，而不是大小乘以份数 — 当副本是共享空间的克隆时，那样承诺过头了。";
"Helm’s memory no longer grows while its windows are closed." = "窗口关闭时，Helm 的内存不再增长。";
"Big counts read with digit grouping in your language — “1,499,308 files”, never “1499308 files” — everywhere a count is drawn." = "大数字在您的语言里带着位数分隔显示 — 是“1,499,308 个文件”，绝不是“1499308 个文件”— 凡是显示计数的地方都如此。";
"The log’s filter row keeps to one line in every language: Follow is a glyph now, with its word in the tooltip." = "日志的筛选行在任何语言下都保持一行：“跟随”现在是一个图形符号，词语在它的工具提示里。";
"Login Items & Extensions calls its removal what it is. The confirmation used to ask “Delete?” over a button that says “Move to Trash”, and the report afterwards said moved — one act has one name now, in every language." = "登录项与扩展用正确的名字称呼它的删除操作。确认框曾在写着“移到废纸篓”的按钮上方问“删除吗？”，事后的报告又说已移动 — 现在一个动作只有一个名字，在所有语言里都是如此。";
"A removal that got no answer no longer reads as a success. Login Items & Extensions used to say “Moved to the Trash — 0 B” about work nobody confirmed, and a scan that got no answer claimed “No leftovers found”; the page keeps its list and your ticks now and says only what it knows. The Uninstaller keeps your review the same way, and its Trash window stays open instead of writing every group off as dismissed." = "没有得到回应的删除不再显示为成功。登录项与扩展曾在什么都没动的情况下写“已移到废纸篓”，没有回应的扫描则断言“未找到残留项”；页面现在保留列表和您的勾选，只说它知道的。卸载器同样保留您的确认清单，它的废纸篓窗口也保持打开，而不是把每个分组都当作已忽略而关闭。";
"The Uninstaller asks whether an app is running at the moment of removal, not when the review was built. An app that quit no longer leaves a dead button, an app still running is quit and waited for — and if it will not go, nothing moves at all, never the half-uninstall that deletes an app’s files out from under it." = "卸载器在删除的那一刻询问应用是否正在运行，而不是在生成确认清单时。已退出的应用不再留下失效的按钮；仍在运行的应用会被退出并等待 — 如果它不退出，就什么也不移动：只留下应用本身而删走文件，正是要避免的半途卸载。";
"A file Helm was not allowed to read is not a leftover. It used to be badged as one — with a working “Turn off” beside it — or offered for removal on the strength of its name alone; it says “Unreadable” now, and “Select all” never ticks it." = "Helm 无权读取的文件不是残留项。它曾被贴上这个标记 — 旁边还有一个可用的“关闭”按钮 — 或仅凭名字就被列为可删除；现在它显示“无法读取”，“全选”永远不会勾选它。";
"Login Items & Extensions checks that a scanned folder is the folder it names, and a login item is switched off by the job its file actually registers. A folder swapped for a link could have other software’s files listed and offered to the Trash, and a file claiming another job’s name could switch that job off." = "登录项与扩展会核实被扫描的文件夹就是它名字所指的那一个，登录项也按其文件真正注册的任务来关闭。被换成链接的文件夹曾能让其他软件的文件被列出并送往废纸篓，冒用别的任务名字的文件曾能关掉那个任务。";
"The switch that looks for leftovers when an app goes to the Trash says when it cannot watch. It used to report itself on with nothing behind it — a watcher macOS refused, or missing Full Disk Access, went unmentioned." = "当应用进入废纸篓时自动查找残留文件的开关，会说出它无法监视的时候。它曾在毫无凭据的情况下报告已开启 — macOS 拒绝了监视器，或缺少完全磁盘访问权限，都无人提及。";
"An app list the Uninstaller never received no longer reads as a Mac with no apps on it, and a system extension macOS refuses to remove states its reason again, with the “Open Extensions…” button beside it." = "卸载器从未收到的应用列表不再显示成一台没有应用的 Mac，macOS 拒绝移除的系统扩展会重新说明原因 — 旁边带着“打开扩展…”按钮。";
"A scan of Login Items & Extensions that finds nothing says so, and when everything found is hidden by the filter, that has its own sentence — right under the menu that decides it. The count above the list now counts the rows you see, not the rows that may be ticked." = "登录项与扩展的扫描一无所获时会说出来；当找到的内容全部被筛选器隐藏时，也有专门的一句话 — 就在决定筛选的菜单下方。列表上方的计数现在数的是您看到的行，而不是可以勾选的行。";
"The buttons of Login Items & Extensions keep their whole words in every language, the report of a partly failed removal stops squeezing the list beneath it, and nothing on the page can start new work while a removal is running." = "登录项与扩展的按钮在所有语言里保留完整的词，部分失败的删除报告不再挤压下方的列表，删除进行中页面上的任何控件都无法开始新的工作。";
"Keyboard's menu-bar indicator now offers “Emoji & Symbols”: one press opens the system emoji palette in the app you are typing in — Helm stays in the background, and your focus does not move." = "键盘指示器的菜单新增“表情与符号”：按一下即可在你正在输入的应用中打开系统表情面板 — Helm 不会跳到前台，焦点也不会移动。";
"Keep Awake's lines in the log now file under the module filter's own name for it. Lines written before this build keep the old spelling, so the module menu may list two words for one module until the log rolls over — that is the old lines draining away, not a defect." = "“保持唤醒”的日志行现在使用与模块筛选器一致的名称。此版本之前写入的行保留旧写法，所以模块菜单会在一段时间里为同一个模块显示两个词 — 那是旧行在逐渐退出，不是故障。";
"Keyboard's menu-bar indicator now matches the system's own input menu: each layout row shows its badge, a new “Show Input Source Name” switch puts the layout's name in the menu bar instead of the badge, and “Open Keyboard Settings…” takes you straight to the pane that opens." = "键盘指示器的菜单现在更接近系统自带的输入菜单：每个输入法都显示自己的徽标，新增的“显示输入法名称”开关会用输入法名称代替徽标显示在菜单栏中，“打开键盘设置…”会直接跳到对应的设置面板。";
"The Uninstaller's Apps tab now says why it's empty — a search that matched nothing, a Mac with no more apps to show, or a list still being read — instead of showing the same blank screen for all three." = "卸载器的“App”标签页现在会说明为什么是空的——搜索没有结果、Mac 上确实没有更多应用了、还是列表尚未返回——而不是三种情况都显示同一个空白画面。";

"Connected by these rules" = "由这些规则连接";
"Remove rule" = "删除规则";
"Move to another VPN" = "移到其他 VPN";
"No longer in System Settings" = "已不在系统设置中";
"Show fewer" = "收起";
"Drag an app here" = "把应用拖到这里";
"The VPN page arranges its connections without a gap at the end of a row — four of them sit two by two — and a Mac with more than six shows six with “Show all” under them. Whatever is connected comes first, so it is never the one behind the button." = "VPN 页面排列连接时不再让行尾留空——四个会排成两行两列；配置超过六个的 Mac 只显示六个，下方是“显示全部”。已连接的排在最前，绝不会被折叠在按钮后面。";
"A VPN is a row now — its name, the protocol as a tag, what it is doing, and one button: a power key to switch the tunnel, a cross to abandon a handshake. Twice as many fit on the page, and the button says its word when you rest the pointer on it." = "每个 VPN 现在是一行：名称、作为标签的协议、当前状态，以及一个按钮 — 电源用来切换隧道，叉号用来放弃握手。同一页能放下两倍，把指针停在按钮上会显示它的词。";
"No rules" = "没有规则";
"Applies to this connection only" = "仅适用于此连接";
"Everything about one VPN is on its own card now: the applications that raise it, and how loudly it speaks. Two buttons under the card open them." = "关于某个 VPN 的一切现在都在它自己的卡片上：会把它连起来的应用，以及它说话的音量。卡片下方的两个按钮分别打开它们。";
"A rule whose VPN has a long name no longer pushes the VPN page out of the window, and the rows’ menus line up in a column." = "VPN 名字很长的规则不会再把 VPN 页面挤出窗口，各行的菜单也对齐成一列。";
"Each VPN can be told how loudly to speak on its own — a notification, the menu bar or nothing, whether the icon spins and what colour it turns. The ones you have not changed keep following the app’s own setting." = "每个 VPN 都可以单独设定音量：通知、菜单栏或什么都不做，图标是否旋转，以及旋转时用什么颜色。你没有改过的，仍然沿用应用本身的设置。";
"The panel’s “permissions not granted” notice is no longer drawn inside a second panel of its own: it is one line across the width, like anything else in the panel." = "面板里“权限未授予”的提示不再画在另一层卡片里：它就是横贯整宽的一行，和面板里其他内容一样。";

